        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
            Build Your Automation Strategy with OnnaSoft
        </h2>
        <p>
            Every business has its own operational challenges, technology
            environment, and growth objectives. A tailored automation strategy
            helps ensure that software supports the way your organization needs
            to work rather than forcing your team to adapt to unnecessary
            complexity.
        </p>
        <p>
            OnnaSoft helps businesses develop custom software, integrate
